<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">生成学员激活码</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24rpx;">
      输入学员 UID 与有效期天数，生成后复制发给学员。学员在「激活工具」页输入 UID 和激活码即可解锁。
    </view>
    <view class="field-label">学员 UID（可批量，每行一个）</view>
    <textarea class="input" style="height: 160rpx;" placeholder="XB10086&#10;XB10087" value="{{uids}}" bindinput="onUidsInput" maxlength="2000" />
    <view class="field-label" style="margin-top: 24rpx;">有效期（天）</view>
    <view class="days-row">
      <view class="day-chip {{days === d ? 'on' : ''}}" wx:for="{{dayOptions}}" wx:for-item="d" wx:key="*this" bindtap="onDaysTap" data-days="{{d}}">{{d}} 天</view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-primary {{uids ? '' : 'disabled'}}" style="margin-top: 36rpx;" bindtap="onGenerate">
      生成激活码
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{results.length > 0}}">
    <view class="section-title">生成结果</view>
    <view class="result-item" wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="uid">
      <view class="result-uid">UID {{item.uid}}</view>
      <view class="result-code" user-select>{{item.code}}</view>
      <view class="result-exp">有效期至 {{item.expiresText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top: 24rpx;" bindtap="onCopyAll">复制全部</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">教师码（本机教师模式解锁用）</view>
    <view class="muted">
      教师码按月轮换，仅限教师本人持有。换新手机后在「我的」页连点头像 5 次输入教师码即可解锁。
    </view>
    <view class="teacher-code" user-select>{{teacherCode}}</view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top: 20rpx;" bindtap="onCopyTeacherCode">复制教师码</view>
  </view>
</view>
